  <HediffDef ParentName="AddedBodyPartBase">
    <defName>CVG_Graft_MinerArm</defName>
    <label>Dao miner's arm</label>
    <labelNoun>a Dao miner's arm</labelNoun>
    <description>The miners of the Black Jade Mountains carved tunnels through stone that had swallowed three tribulations. Their arms, reforged with earth-veined marrow, listen to the rock and strike where it is already willing to break.\n\nMining speed +100%, mining yield +15%.\n\nReplaces the whole arm, hand included.\nCelestial dissonance +0.1.</description>
