  <HediffDef ParentName="AddedBodyPartBase">
    <defName>CVG_Graft_SmithHand</defName>
    <label>celestial smith's hand</label>
    <labelNoun>a celestial smith's hand</labelNoun>
    <description>Legend says the first flying sword was hammered by a smith who had traded his hand for one of living phoenix-bronze. It never feels the heat of the forge, and it remembers every blade it has ever folded.\n\nGeneral labor speed +20% per hand (smithing, crafting and sculpting).\n\nReplaces only the hand; the arm stays natural.\nCelestial dissonance +0.1.</description>
    <descriptionHyperlinks><ThingDef>CVG_Graft_SmithHand</ThingDef></descriptionHyperlinks>
    <spawnThingOnRemoved>CVG_Graft_SmithHand</spawnThingOnRemoved>
    <addedPartProps>
