  <HediffDef ParentName="AddedBodyPartBase">
    <defName>CVG_Graft_AlchemistHand</defName>
    <label>alchemist's hand</label>
    <labelNoun>an alchemist's hand</labelNoun>
    <description>Pill refiners of the Heavenly Cauldron Pavilion graft spirit-jade nerves into their palms so they can feel the fire inside the cauldron breathe. A pill made by such a hand carries less of the poison that every elixir hides.\n\nDrug synthesis and cooking +30%, tend quality +5%.\n\nReplaces only the hand; the arm stays natural.\nCelestial dissonance +0.1.</description>
    <descriptionHyperlinks><ThingDef>CVG_Graft_AlchemistHand</ThingDef></descriptionHyperlinks>
    <spawnThingOnRemoved>CVG_Graft_AlchemistHand</spawnThingOnRemoved>
    <addedPartProps>
